,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"Ten years old, at the kitchen table, doing the electric bill. That's a lot to be responsible for that young — and the rule you took from it makes sense for a kid in that spot. Stretching the math was the only power you had.\n\nBut that rule was built for a ten-year-old trying to keep the lights on. Do you think it's the right rule for the person holding a notebook with a three-year plan in it?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"Ten years old, at the kitchen table, doing the electric bill. That's a lot to be responsible for that young — and the rule you took from it makes sense for a kid in that spot. Stretching the math was the only power you had.\n\nBut that rule was built for a ten-year-old trying to keep the lights on. Do you think it's the right rule for the person holding a notebook with a three-year plan in it?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3492,"promptTokens":1462,"completionTokens":256,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:43:20"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":43,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"b56503a342794a90a2bd68a033a07e12","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":1.5843473143725006E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b0507d8beecf50d38480f4b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491800210,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:43:20","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b0507d8beecf50d38480f4b","chatId":"0c7987a981074afaadfa08912c8ab076","sessionId":null,"userId":130803,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"i was ten and doing the electric bill at the kitchen table, so. probably there. you dont get to want stuff when the math says no, you just get to make it stretch","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":42,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"b56503a342794a90a2bd68a033a07e12","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":1.5843473143725006E-4,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6b0507d8beecf50d38480f4c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491800207,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:43:20","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b0507d2beecf50d38480f46","chatId":"0c7987a981074afaadfa08912c8ab076","sessionId":null,"userId":130803,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"That's a harsh rule — that wanting something you can't currently afford makes the wanting itself foolish. Where do you think you picked that one up?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"That's a harsh rule — that wanting something you can't currently afford makes the wanting itself foolish. Where do you think you picked that one up?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takin